              },
              "subContentId": "5627dc6e-c943-439e-ab4a-4531b7f24264"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Auguste Rodin</strong><br>\nAuguste Rodin was born in Paris in 1840 to a working-class family. At age 14, he entered the Petite École, a school that trained craftsmen in the arts. Rodin's early talent for sculpture emerged here, but he faced academic rejection from the École des Beaux-Arts, the prestigious art school in Paris. Despite this setback, he continued to pursue sculpture, developing his skills while supporting himself with craftsman jobs.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Struggle and Early Works</strong><br>\nRodin struggled to gain recognition in the early years of his career. His first major work, \"The Man with the Broken Nose,\" was rejected by the Paris Salon, the official art exhibition of the Académie des Beaux-Arts in Paris. Rodin spent years doing decorative stonework to make ends meet. These experiences shaped his distinctive approach to sculpture, focusing on realism and the human form.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Age of Bronze</strong><br>\nIn 1877, Rodin's reputation began to grow with \"The Age of Bronze,\" a life-sized sculpture of a young soldier that was so lifelike it caused controversy. Critics accused Rodin of taking a casting from a living model because of its detailed realism. Despite these accusations, \"The Age of Bronze\" established Rodin's name in the art world, leading to more commissions and recognition.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
